            <p class="about-team-degree"><span class="about-team-detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎓</span>B.Tech. &ndash; Computer Science and Design</p>
            <p class="about-team-year"><span class="about-team-detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</span>First Year</p>
