  </section>

  <!-- Section: Scheme Categories (Clickable) -->
  <section id="categories" class="section-py">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">National Welfare Sectors</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Browse Schemes By Sector</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          <span class="dynamic-schemes-count">69</span> central &amp; state welfare programs across 8 livelihood sectors. Select a sector to discover schemes designed for your occupation and life stage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="categories-grid">
        <a href="results.html?sector=agriculture" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">🌾</div>
          <span class="sector-badge agri">Agriculture</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Farmers &amp; Agriculture</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">PM-KISAN ₹6,000/yr income support, Fasal Bima crop insurance, Kisan Credit Card &amp; PM-KMY pension.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=business" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">💼</div>
          <span class="sector-badge business">MSME &amp; Business</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">MSME, Business &amp; Artisans</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">PM Mudra loan ₹50K–₹20L, PM Vishwakarma toolkit &amp; ₹3L loan, SVANidhi street vendor credit.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=healthcare" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">🩺</div>
          <span class="sector-badge health">Healthcare</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Healthcare &amp; Ayushman</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY ₹5 Lakh free hospital cover, Jan Aushadhi generic medicines, PMMVY maternity benefit.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=housing" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">🏠</div>
          <span class="sector-badge housing">Housing</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Housing &amp; Shelter</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">PMAY-Gramin ₹1.2–2.0L pucca house grant &amp; PMAY-Urban ₹2.67L interest subsidy for EWS/LIG/MIG.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=women" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">👩</div>
          <span class="sector-badge women">Women &amp; Child</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Women &amp; Child Empowerment</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">Lakhpati Didi SHG credit, Ujjwala free LPG, Sukanya Samriddhi, Mahila Samman 7.5% savings.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=workers" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">🔨</div>
          <span class="sector-badge worker">Labor &amp; Workers</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Workers &amp; Labor Welfare</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">e-Shram UAN card, PM Shram Yogi Maandhan ₹3,000/mo pension, MGNREGA 100-day guaranteed work.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=senior" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">👴</div>
          <span class="sector-badge senior">Senior Citizens</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Senior Citizens &amp; Pension</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">Atal Pension Yojana ₹1K–5K/mo guarantee, IGNOAPS old age pension, PMJJBY &amp; PMSBY insurance cover.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="results.html?sector=scholarship" class="category-card">
          <div class="category-icon-box">🎓</div>
          <span class="sector-badge scholarship">Scholarships</span>
          <h3 class="category-title">Scholarships &amp; Education</h3>
          <p class="category-desc">Central Sector, NSP post-matric, AICTE Pragati, PMKVY skills, state-level tuition reimbursement.</p>
          <span class="category-link">View Schemes →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section: Featured Schemes Cards -->
  <section id="featured-schemes" class="multi-schemes-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Flagship National Programs</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Featured Government Schemes</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          Flagship welfare programs across healthcare, agriculture, artisan skills, business, and education — verified eligibility, transparent scores, and direct official application routes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="home-scheme-cards-grid">
        
        <!-- Scheme 1: Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY -->
        <article class="home-scheme-card">
          <div class="home-scheme-card-body">
            <div class="home-scheme-card-header">
              <div>
                <span class="home-scheme-category" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.12);color:#f87171;border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.3);">Healthcare</span>
                <h3 class="home-scheme-name">Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY — Free Health Coverage</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="home-score-badge match-state-excellent">
                <span class="home-score-num">₹5 Lakh/yr</span>
                <span class="home-score-lbl">Hospital Cover</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="home-criteria-box">
              <strong>Eligibility:</strong>
              Families in SECC 2011 database, BPL cardholders &amp; state-notified poor families. 1,500+ empanelled hospitals nationwide. Cashless treatment for 1,949 procedures.
            </div>

            <div class="home-docs-box">
              <strong>Required Documents:</strong>
              <div class="docs-tag-list">
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ Aadhaar Card</span>
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ Ration Card / BPL Proof</span>
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ SECC Eligibility</span>
                <span class="doc-tag">Ayushman Golden Card</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-scheme-actions">
            <a href="scheme-details.html?id=ayushman-bharat-pmjay" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="flex: 1;">View Details →</a>
            <a href="https://pmjay.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Official Portal ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Scheme 2: PM-KISAN -->
        <article class="home-scheme-card">
          <div class="home-scheme-card-body">
            <div class="home-scheme-card-header">
              <div>
                <span class="home-scheme-category" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12);color:#4ade80;border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.3);">Agriculture</span>
                <h3 class="home-scheme-name">PM-KISAN Samman Nidhi — Farmer Income Support</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="home-score-badge match-state-excellent">
                <span class="home-score-num">₹6,000/yr</span>
                <span class="home-score-lbl">Direct Bank Transfer</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="home-criteria-box">
              <strong>Eligibility:</strong>
              All small &amp; marginal farmer families owning up to 2 hectares of land. Excludes income taxpayers, doctors, lawyers, and Govt employees in Class 1 posts.
            </div>

            <div class="home-docs-box">
              <strong>Required Documents:</strong>
              <div class="docs-tag-list">
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ Aadhaar Card</span>
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ Land Records (Khasra/Khatauni)</span>
                <span class="doc-tag present">✓ Bank Passbook</span>
                <span class="doc-tag">Mobile (OTP)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="home-scheme-actions">
            <a href="scheme-details.html?id=pm-kisan" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="flex: 1;">View Details →</a>
            <a href="https://pmkisan.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">pmkisan.gov.in ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>

                <!-- Scheme 3: PM Vishwakarma -->
        <article class="home-scheme-card">
          <div class="home-scheme-card-body">
            <div class="home-scheme-card-header">
              <div>
                <span class="home-scheme-category" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.12);color:#fbbf24;border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.3);">Artisans &amp; MSME</span>
                <h3 class="home-scheme-name">PM Vishwakarma — Artisan Skill &amp; Credit Scheme</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="home-score-badge match-state-excellent">
                <span class="home-score-num">₹3 Lakh Loan</span>
                <span class="home-score-lbl">@ 5% Interest + Toolkit</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="home-criteria-box">
              <strong>Eligibility:</strong>
